    previewImage: "assets/pd-drawings-method-schematic.png",
    previewAlt: "method schematic of a mixture-of-experts model: tablet recordings feed a tabular expert, a kaggle spiral scan feeds an image expert, and a learned gate combines them into one prediction per person, above a subject-safe protocol band (class-aware participant ids, participant-grouped splits, fold-local fitting, one vote per person). the two-modality layout is exercised on synthetic paired fixtures — the two real datasets here have different participants and cannot be fused. sample scan: kaggle parkinson's drawings (kmader), CC BY-NC-ND 4.0",
